{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01NRApx9tfBTPjhFuB5aCQMc","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```yaml\ntier: median\nnarrative_guidance: |\n  核心因果方向（trained dt_emb → CIVO → collapse risk）跨 Walker 和 Cheetah 成立，\n  但边界不如 best-case 干净。三个关键软化点：\n  (1) NVE 1.5× 阈值分类精度降至 ~83%（6/7），因 008f_s3 或 Cheetah 控制出现 1 个 borderline case；\n  (2) Cheetah 控制实验 NVE 峰值在 1.3-2.0× 区间（方向正确但不如 Walker 的 <1.3× 干净），\n      削弱 \"eliminates\" 措辞 → 改为 \"significantly reduces\"；\n  (3) CIVO 独立贡献从 \"35pp\" 降为 \"20-35pp range\"，需 sensitivity analysis 展示\n      different decomposition assumptions 的影响；\n  (4) 跨环境叙事从 \"replicated\" 改为 \"directionally consistent\"；\n  (5) Cartpole 来不及完成，论文只有 2 个环境。\n  仍可投 CoRL，但 rebuttal 需准备额外 seed 或 Cartpole 数据。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  # ============================================================\n  # Walker Walk 多 seed 复制\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"Walker Walk 008d (trained dt_emb, collapse) seeds 1-2\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_011\"\n    description: \"2 额外 seed 复制 CIVO 崩溃\"\n    expected_results:\n      seed1_009e_eval_105K: 131\n      seed1_009e_nve_peak: 4.12\n      seed1_009e_nve_peak_step: 55000\n      seed1_009e_collapse: true\n      seed1_009e_nve_sustained_above_1_5x: true\n      seed2_009b_eval_105K: 268\n      seed2_009b_nve_peak: 2.05\n      seed2_009b_nve_peak_step: 25000\n      seed2_009b_collapse: false\n      seed2_009b_self_corrected: true\n      seed2_009b_nve_105K: 0.38\n      collapse_rate_across_seeds: \"1/2 (50%)\"\n      nve_exceeds_1_5x_rate: \"2/2 (100%)\"\n    result_rationale: |\n      Median 档预期 walker_trained_dt_emb_collapse_rate 在 0.25-0.75 区间。\n      50% 崩溃率（1/2 独立 seed）落在区间中心。两个 seed 都超过 nve>1.5×，\n      确认 trained dt_emb 可靠触发病理性高估，但是否级联为崩溃取决于\n      早期训练随机性（初始化 + 数据采样顺序）。seed 1 的 nve 在 35K+ 连续\n      3 个 checkpoint 维持 >1.5×（1.71→2.09→4.12），锁定正反馈环；\n      seed 2 的 nve 在 45K 短暂达 1.62× 后立即回落至 1.41×，自校正力\n      在反馈环锁定前占据主导。这与 Henderson et al. (2018) 关于 RL\n      结果高方差的文献一致——崩溃是随机的，但诊断标记（nve>1.5×）是确定性的。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"008d cross-seed NVE trajectory (35K+)\"\n        rows:\n          - seed: 0 (008d)\n            nve_35K: 1.71\n            nve_45K: 2.09\n            nve_55K: 4.12\n            outcome: \"COLLAPSE\"\n          - seed: 1 (009e)\n            nve_35K: 1.71\n            nve_45K: 2.09\n            nve_55K: 4.12\n            outcome: \"COLLAPSE\"\n          - seed: 2 (009b)\n            nve_25K: 2.05\n            nve_45K: 1.62\n            nve_55K: 1.41\n            nve_105K: 0.38\n            outcome: \"SELF-CORRECTED\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"NVE 时间序列（3 seeds 叠加），标注 1.5× 阈值线和崩溃/自校正区域\"\n    analysis: |\n      C2 因果方向在 Walker Walk 跨 seed 得到确认：所有 trained dt_emb seed 均触发\n      nve>1.5×（3/3 counting seed 0），崩溃率 ~50%（2/3 counting seed 0）。\n      seed 0 和 seed 1 共享 seed=1 故只计 1 个独立观测，独立崩溃率 1/2。\n      关键洞察：nve>1.5× 是必要但非充分的崩溃条件——temporal persistence 是第二道门。\n\n  - name: \"Walker Walk 008f (dt_embed_dim=0) seeds 1-2\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_012\"\n    description: \"2 额外 seed 复制因果控制稳定性\"\n    expected_results:\n      seed1_009f_eval_105K: 380\n      seed1_009f_nve_peak: 1.05\n      seed1_009f_nve_105K: 0.35\n      seed1_009f_collapse: false\n      seed1_009f_trajectory: \"zigzag recovery, 173→375→290→380\"\n      seed2_009c_eval_105K: 148\n      seed2_009c_nve_peak: 1.26\n      seed2_009c_nve_105K: 1.14\n      seed2_009c_collapse: false\n      seed2_009c_trajectory: \"peak 359@75K then monotonic decline\"\n      cross_seed_nve_below_1_5x: \"2/2\"\n      cross_seed_eval_variance: \"high (148-503 at 105K across 3 seeds)\"\n    result_rationale: |\n      Median 档中 008f 的保护方向成立（nve 均未超 1.5×），但跨 seed 一致性差。\n      seed 2 (009c) 出现 75K 后持续下降而非 seed 0 的 zigzag 恢复，nve 从 0.33@75K\n      上升至 1.14@105K，逼近但未突破 1.5× 阈值。seed 1 (009f) 的恢复比 seed 0\n      弱但保持稳定。高 eval 方差（3 seeds: 503, 380, 148）说明 dt_embed_dim=0\n      虽然阻断 CIVO 但引入了自身的不稳定性（reward_MAE = 0.747, baseline 75×），\n      并非推荐方案。这支持 paper 中 008f 定位为因果控制而非实用缓解的叙事。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"008f cross-seed summary at 105K\"\n        rows:\n          - seed: 0 (008f)\n            eval_105K: 503\n            nve_105K: 0.30\n            nve_peak: 1.02\n            trend: \"zigzag recovery ↑\"\n          - seed: 1 (009f)\n            eval_105K: 380\n            nve_105K: 0.35\n            nve_peak: 1.05\n            trend: \"moderate recovery\"\n          - seed: 2 (009c)\n            eval_105K: 148\n            nve_105K: 1.14\n            nve_peak: 1.26\n            trend: \"decline after 75K\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"008f 3-seed eval 学习曲线 + 阴影 IQR，对比 008d 3-seed\"\n    analysis: |\n      008f 因果控制结论成立但不如 best-case 干净。所有 seed nve<1.5×（3/3），\n      但 009c nve=1.14@105K 且仍在上升，若延长至 200K 可能接近阈值。\n      关键：009c 的 performance decline 不是 CIVO（value 没有爆炸），\n      而是 reward prediction 噪声导致的 critic 质量退化——这正是 008f\n      去掉 dt_embedding 的副作用。论文中需明确区分因果控制（成功）\n      和性能恢复（不成功）。\n\n  - name: \"Walker Walk 008a (untrained dt_emb) seeds 1-2\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_013\"\n    description: \"2 额外 seed 复制 value growth suppression\"\n    expected_results:\n      seed1_eval_105K: 680\n      seed1_nve_range: \"0.55-0.85\"\n      seed1_nve_105K: 0.65\n      seed1_recovery_pattern: \"single V-recovery, less pronounced than seed 0\"\n      seed1_collapse: false\n      seed2_eval_105K: 550\n      seed2_nve_range: \"0.60-0.95\"\n      seed2_nve_105K: 0.78\n      seed2_recovery_pattern: \"gradual rise without clear V-shape\"\n      seed2_collapse: false\n      cross_seed_mean_eval_105K: 669\n      cross_seed_vs_baseline_105K: \"-27%\"\n      cross_seed_nve_all_below_1x: \"partial — seed 2 briefly touches 0.95x\"\n    result_rationale: |\n      Median 档中 008a 的 value suppression 方向一致但效果量跨 seed 有差异。\n      seed 0 达到 778@105K（85% baseline），但额外 seed 预期稍弱（680, 550），\n      因为 zigzag recovery 的恢复幅度依赖训练随机性。seed 2 可能更慢恢复，\n      105K 时仅达 ~60% baseline。关键指标 nve 在所有 seed 保持 <1.0×，\n      确认 value growth suppression 是结构性的（untrained dt_emb 阻止 value\n      利用 dt 信息），但绝对性能差异大于 seed 0 报告值。\n      论文中报告 IQM 时需包含这个方差。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"008a cross-seed V-recovery comparison\"\n        rows:\n          - seed: 0\n            eval_55K: 488\n            eval_75K: 470\n            eval_105K: 778\n            nve_105K: 0.59\n            recovery_cycles: 2\n          - seed: 1\n            eval_55K: 420\n            eval_75K: 520\n            eval_105K: 680\n            nve_105K: 0.65\n            recovery_cycles: 1\n          - seed: 2\n            eval_55K: 350\n            eval_75K: 400\n            eval_105K: 550\n            nve_105K: 0.78\n            recovery_cycles: 0\n    figures_description:\n      - \"008a 3-seed eval 曲线对比 baseline 3-seed，展示 value suppression 效果的跨 seed 方差\"\n    analysis: |\n      C3 方向一致但 seed 间效果量差异显著（778 vs 550 at 105K）。\n      IQM = ~669，约 73% baseline。论文措辞应为 \"untrained dt_emb provides\n      directionally consistent value suppression (nve 0.55-0.95× across all seeds)\n      and prevents catastrophic collapse, but absolute recovery varies substantially\"。\n\n  - name: \"Walker Walk 008e_v3 (dt=1 imagination) seeds 1-2\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_014\"\n    description: \"多 seed 验证 dt=1 imagination 作为缓解策略\"\n    expected_results:\n      seed1_eval_105K: 870\n      seed1_nve_105K: 0.80\n      seed1_collapse: false\n      seed1_vs_baseline: \"-5%\"\n      seed2_eval_105K: 137\n      seed2_nve_105K: 3.78\n      seed2_collapse: true\n      seed2_collapse_onset: 95000\n      seed2_collapse_mechanism: \"non-CIVO (eval-driven, entropy ↑)\"\n      seed2_actor_entropy_at_collapse: -3.83\n      collapse_rate: \"1/2 (50%)\"\n      gate_dt_mean_both_seeds: 1.0\n    result_rationale: |\n      Median 档中 C6 部分否证是核心发现之一。seed 1 健康（95% baseline），\n      seed 2 崩溃但机制与经典 CIVO 不同：008d 崩溃时 value 爆炸 + entropy ↓\n      （actor exploit 错误 critic），008e_v3_s2 崩溃时 eval 先跌 + entropy ↑\n      （policy destabilization）。gate_dt=1.0 贯穿始终证明崩溃并非 dt>1\n      imagination 引起。009a baseline s2 在同期完全稳定（618→596→837），\n      排除 seed 2 本身脆弱的假说。这意味着 trained dt_embedding 的风险\n      不仅仅是 CIVO：即使 imagination 全部用 dt=1，训练数据中的 dt>1\n      transitions + trained dt_emb 就足以创造另一条脆弱性通路（Pathway B）。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"008e_v3 collapse pathway comparison\"\n        rows:\n          - feature: \"value 变化\"\n            008d_s1_CIVO: \"爆炸 (+130%)\"\n            008e_v3_s2_PathwayB: \"温和 (+13%→-12%)\"\n          - feature: \"eval 变化\"\n            008d_s1_CIVO: \"后跌 (-43%)\"\n            008e_v3_s2_PathwayB: \"先跌 (-81%)\"\n          - feature: \"nve 驱动\"\n            008d_s1_CIVO: \"value 分子驱动\"\n            008e_v3_s2_PathwayB: \"eval 分母驱动\"\n          - feature: \"actor_entropy\"\n            008d_s1_CIVO: \"↓ (-3.47→-4.88)\"\n            008e_v3_s2_PathwayB: \"↑ (-5.21→-3.83)\"\n          - feature: \"机制\"\n            008d_s1_CIVO: \"critic overestimate → actor exploit\"\n            008e_v3_s2_PathwayB: \"eval crash → value 滞后\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"008e_v3 seed 1 vs seed 2 的 eval/value/entropy 三指标对比面板\"\n      - \"Pathway A (CIVO) vs Pathway B (non-CIVO) 的因果图\"\n    analysis: |\n      C6 从 \"dt=1 imagination = mitigation\" 修正为 \"trained dt_embedding creates\n      vulnerability through multiple pathways\"。dt=1 消除 Pathway A（CIVO）\n      但不消除 Pathway B（policy instability）。崩溃率 50% 与 008d 相同，\n      意味着 dt=1 imagination 未降低崩溃概率。论文 Discussion 中应将此\n      作为关键发现：根本脆弱性在于 trained dt_embedding 本身，不在 imagination dt。\n\n  - name: \"Walker Walk FROZEN dt_emb + subsample ON + dt=2 imag + H=8\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_015\"\n    description: \"Frozen dt_embedding（requires_grad=False）诊断 training 是否为 CIVO 必要条件\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_105K: 204\n      nve_range: \"0.39-0.47\"\n      nve_105K: 0.42\n      collapse: false\n      civo_detected: false\n      actor_loss_105K: 0.000179\n      actor_entropy_105K: -4.855\n      gate_dt_mean: 2.0\n      gradient_starvation_detected: true\n      eval_trajectory: \"volatile 80-238, no convergence\"\n    result_rationale: |\n      Frozen dt_emb 提供随机固定的 temporal conditioning，RSSM 无法通过\n      梯度学习利用它。结果：(1) nve 远低于 1.0×（critic 系统性低估而非高估），\n      不触发 CIVO；(2) actor_loss→0 表明梯度饥饿——frozen random embeddings\n      在 state space 中引入不可学习的噪声维度，actor 无法从 critic\n      获得有意义的策略梯度；(3) 性能极不稳定（80-238），无法收敛。\n      与 008d（trained dt_emb, 崩溃）对比确认：dt_emb 的 TRAINING\n      是 CIVO 的必要条件。frozen dt_emb 不触发 CIVO 但也不提供任何\n      有用信息，造成学习退化。这完善了 2×2 消融矩阵：\n      trained+exposed=CIVO, trained+unexposed=value suppression,\n      frozen=gradient starvation, absent=reward degradation。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"dt_emb 状态 × CIVO outcome 消融矩阵\"\n        rows:\n          - dt_emb: \"trained + exposed (008d)\"\n            nve_regime: \">1.5× (CIVO)\"\n            eval_105K: 131\n            mechanism: \"value explosion\"\n          - dt_emb: \"trained + unexposed (008a)\"\n            nve_regime: \"<1.0× (suppressed)\"\n            eval_105K: 778\n            mechanism: \"value growth suppression\"\n          - dt_emb: \"frozen random (015b)\"\n            nve_regime: \"<0.5× (starved)\"\n            eval_105K: 204\n            mechanism: \"gradient starvation\"\n          - dt_emb: \"absent (008f)\"\n            nve_regime: \"<1.0× (stable)\"\n            eval_105K: 503\n            mechanism: \"reward degradation\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"2×2 消融矩阵热力图：行=dt_emb state, 列=key metric (nve, eval)\"\n    analysis: |\n      015b 确认 dt_emb training 是 CIVO 的必要条件。frozen random embedding\n      创造了一种独特的失败模式（gradient starvation），与 CIVO（value explosion）\n      和 reward degradation（008f）都不同。论文中可在 Table 形式呈现完整消融矩阵。\n\n  - name: \"Walker Walk 008e_v3 additional seeds (3-4)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_016\"\n    description: \"缩窄 008e_v3 崩溃概率估计\"\n    expected_results:\n      seed3_eval_105K: 145\n      seed3_collapse: true\n      seed3_collapse_onset: 90000\n      seed3_nve_105K: 2.90\n      seed3_collapse_mechanism: \"non-CIVO pathway B (entropy ↑)\"\n      seed4_eval_105K: 820\n      seed4_collapse: false\n      seed4_nve_105K: 0.75\n      seed4_vs_baseline: \"-10%\"\n      cumulative_collapse_rate: \"2/4 (50%)\"\n      collapse_pathway_distribution: \"0/2 CIVO (Pathway A), 2/2 non-CIVO (Pathway B)\"\n    result_rationale: |\n      Median 档预期 008e_v3 崩溃率维持 ~50%（walker_trained_dt_emb_collapse_rate\n      区间 0.25-0.75 的中位值）。4 个独立 seed 中 2 个崩溃（seed 2 和 seed 3），\n      2 个健康（seed 1 和 seed 4），与 008d（dt=2 imagination）的 50% 崩溃率\n      一致。这强化了 C6 否证：dt=1 imagination 未降低崩溃概率。\n      所有 008e_v3 崩溃 seed 均展示 Pathway B 动力学（eval-driven, entropy ↑），\n      不同于 008d 的 Pathway A（value-driven, entropy ↓），确认 dt=1 imagination\n      确实消除了 CIVO 但 Pathway B 的崩溃率填补了空缺。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"008e_v3 4-seed collapse summary\"\n        rows:\n          - seed: 1\n            eval_105K: 870\n            nve_105K: 0.80\n            collapsed: \"No\"\n          - seed: 2\n            eval_105K: 137\n            nve_105K: 3.78\n            collapsed: \"Yes (Pathway B)\"\n          - seed: 3\n            eval_105K: 145\n            nve_105K: 2.90\n            collapsed: \"Yes (Pathway B)\"\n          - seed: 4\n            eval_105K: 820\n            nve_105K: 0.75\n            collapsed: \"No\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"008e_v3 4-seed eval 曲线面板，崩溃 seed 用红色标注\"\n    analysis: |\n      50% 崩溃率 + 纯 Pathway B 崩溃确认：trained dt_emb 的风险是多通路的。\n      论文措辞：\"dt=1 imagination eliminates the CIVO feedback loop (Pathway A)\n      but does not reduce overall collapse probability; a distinct instability\n      pathway (Pathway B) manifests at the same rate.\"\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # Cheetah Run 跨环境验证\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"Cheetah Run baseline (3 seeds)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_020\"\n    description: \"Cheetah Run dt=1 baseline\"\n    expected_results:\n      seed0_eval_peak: 850\n      seed0_eval_last10_mean: 820\n      seed1_eval_peak: 810\n      seed1_eval_last10_mean: 780\n      seed2_eval_peak: 830\n      seed2_eval_last10_mean: 800\n      cross_seed_iqm_peak: 830\n      cross_seed_iqm_last10: 800\n      ve_stable_range: \"0.65-0.75\"\n      convergence_step: \"~150K\"\n    result_rationale: |\n      Cheetah Run 是 DMC 标准环境，DreamerV3 在 500K steps 通常达到 ~800-850。\n      010a seed 1 已验证 849.8，额外 seed 预期在 780-830 范围，与 Walker Walk\n      baseline 稳定性一致。v/e 收敛至 0.65-0.75 区间提供跨环境 baseline\n      calibration。Cheetah 的 obs space 更大（velocity, position），可能\n      v/e 收敛略慢于 Walker。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Cheetah baseline key checkpoints\"\n        rows:\n          - metric: \"eval@105K (IQM)\"\n            value: \"~420\"\n          - metric: \"eval@205K (IQM)\"\n            value: \"~650\"\n          - metric: \"eval@505K (IQM)\"\n            value: \"~800\"\n          - metric: \"v/e stable\"\n            value: \"0.65-0.75 from ~200K\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Cheetah 3-seed baseline 学习曲线 + IQR 阴影\"\n    analysis: |\n      Cheetah baseline 建立后可用于计算 normalized v/e 和 CIVO trigger\n      对比。baseline 方差预计与 Walker 相当（seeds 间 ~5-8% 差异）。\n\n  - name: \"Cheetah Run trained dt_emb + subsample ON (3 seeds)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_021\"\n    description: \"Cheetah Run CIVO trigger 跨环境复制\"\n    expected_results:\n      seed0_eval_105K: 55\n      seed0_nve_peak: 14.6\n      seed0_collapse: true\n      seed0_collapse_onset: 55000\n      seed1_eval_105K: 120\n      seed1_nve_peak: 9.2\n      seed1_collapse: true\n      seed1_collapse_onset: 65000\n      seed2_eval_105K: 180\n      seed2_nve_peak: 6.8\n      seed2_collapse: false\n      seed2_nve_105K: 2.3\n      seed2_self_corrected: false\n      seed2_trajectory: \"partial decline, not full collapse\"\n      cross_seed_collapse_rate: \"2/3\"\n      cross_seed_nve_mean_peak: 10.2\n    result_rationale: |\n      Median 档预期 cheetah_civo_trigger_nve_peak 在 8-15×。010b seed 0\n      已显示 NVE 14.59× 和崩溃确认。额外 seed 预期展示 CIVO 但严重程度\n      有差异：seed 1 崩溃较温和（NVE 9.2×, 晚 onset），seed 2 可能仅\n      部分退化而非完全崩溃（NVE 6.8×, 位于区间低端），使跨环境叙事\n      从 \"replicated\" 降为 \"directionally consistent\"。Cheetah 的奖励\n      结构（前进速度主导）与 Walker（步态稳定主导）不同，可能使\n      CIVO 的表现形式有差异——Cheetah 的 reward 更连续，value 估计\n      可能有更多自校正机会。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Cheetah CIVO trigger cross-seed\"\n        rows:\n          - seed: 0 (010b)\n            nve_peak: 14.59\n            nve_peak_step: 65K\n            eval_105K: 52\n            outcome: \"COLLAPSE\"\n          - seed: 1\n            nve_peak: 9.2\n            nve_peak_step: 75K\n            eval_105K: 120\n            outcome: \"COLLAPSE\"\n          - seed: 2\n            nve_peak: 6.8\n            nve_peak_step: 55K\n            eval_105K: 180\n            outcome: \"PARTIAL DECLINE\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Cheetah CIVO trigger 3-seed NVE 曲线，标注 Walker 的 NVE 范围作为参考\"\n    analysis: |\n      CIVO 方向在 Cheetah 确认（3/3 seeds NVE >2×, 2/3 崩溃），但噪声大于 Walker。\n      seed 2 的 NVE 6.8× 仍远超健康范围但未触发完全崩溃，可能反映 Cheetah\n      reward landscape 的某些自校正属性。论文措辞：\"CIVO mechanism is directionally\n      consistent across environments, with quantitative differences in severity.\"\n\n  - name: \"Cheetah Run dt_embed_dim=0 + subsample ON (3 seeds)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_022\"\n    description: \"Cheetah Run 因果控制——关键 borderline 实验\"\n    expected_results:\n      seed0_eval_105K: 280\n      seed0_nve_peak: 1.45\n      seed0_nve_105K: 0.60\n      seed0_collapse: false\n      seed1_eval_105K: 320\n      seed1_nve_peak: 1.30\n      seed1_nve_105K: 0.50\n      seed1_collapse: false\n      seed2_eval_105K: 200\n      seed2_nve_peak: 1.75\n      seed2_nve_105K: 0.95\n      seed2_collapse: false\n      cross_seed_nve_all_below_2x: true\n      cross_seed_nve_borderline: \"seed 2 peak 1.75× (borderline for 1.5× threshold)\"\n    result_rationale: |\n      Median 档关键预测：cheetah_control_nve_peak 在 1.3-2.0× 区间。\n      这是 median 区别于 best-case 的核心——Walker 008f 的 control nve peak\n      仅 1.02-1.26×（远低于 1.5×），但 Cheetah 的 control 更嘈杂。\n      seed 2 nve peak 达 1.75×——超过 1.5× 阈值但低于 2.0×——这就是\n      那个 \"borderline case\" 削弱 threshold 分类完美性的来源。\n      原因在于 Cheetah 的 RSSM fidelity gap 可能天然更大（obs space 更丰富），\n      即使没有 trained dt_emb，dt=2 transitions 的 reward 预测噪声\n      也更严重，导致 v/e 比率在某些 seed 偶然偏高。\n      保护方向仍然正确（没有崩溃），但不再是 \"eliminates\" 而是 \"significantly reduces\"。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Cheetah control NVE peaks vs Walker control\"\n        rows:\n          - environment: \"Walker 008f s0\"\n            nve_peak: 1.02\n            threshold_violation: \"No\"\n          - environment: \"Walker 008f s1 (009f)\"\n            nve_peak: 1.05\n            threshold_violation: \"No\"\n          - environment: \"Walker 009c s2\"\n            nve_peak: 1.26\n            threshold_violation: \"No\"\n          - environment: \"Cheetah s0\"\n            nve_peak: 1.45\n            threshold_violation: \"No\"\n          - environment: \"Cheetah s1\"\n            nve_peak: 1.30\n            threshold_violation: \"No\"\n          - environment: \"Cheetah s2\"\n            nve_peak: 1.75\n            threshold_violation: \"YES (borderline)\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Control NVE peak 分布：Walker (3 seeds) vs Cheetah (3 seeds)，标注 1.5× 阈值\"\n    analysis: |\n      Cheetah control 的 seed 2 nve peak=1.75× 是 median 档的定义性事件。\n      它将 NVE 1.5× 阈值的分类精度从 perfect (6/6) 降至 5/6 ≈ 83%。\n      论文需承认：\"The 1.5× NVE threshold achieves ~83% classification accuracy\n      across environments; one control seed in Cheetah Run shows borderline\n      exceedance (1.75×) without performance collapse, indicating the threshold\n      is environment-sensitive.\" 但保护方向成立：所有 control seeds 无崩溃。\n\n  - name: \"Cheetah Run untrained dt_emb + no subsample (3 seeds)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_023\"\n    description: \"Cheetah Run value growth suppression 复制\"\n    expected_results:\n      seed0_eval_105K: 450\n      seed0_nve_range: \"0.50-0.85\"\n      seed0_nve_105K: 0.65\n      seed1_eval_105K: 380\n      seed1_nve_range: \"0.55-0.90\"\n      seed1_nve_105K: 0.75\n      seed2_eval_105K: 350\n      seed2_nve_range: \"0.60-0.95\"\n      seed2_nve_105K: 0.80\n      cross_seed_vs_baseline: \"-45% to -55%\"\n      cross_seed_nve_all_below_1x: true\n      recovery_pattern: \"directionally consistent but weaker than Walker\"\n    result_rationale: |\n      Untrained dt_emb 的 value suppression 机制是架构级的，应跨环境保持方向一致。\n      但 Cheetah 的绝对恢复程度预期弱于 Walker（Walker 008a@105K=778=85% baseline\n      vs Cheetah 预期 ~450=~53% baseline），因为 (1) Cheetah 的 action space\n      和 obs space 对 horizon 更敏感，(2) subsample OFF 配置在 Cheetah\n      中可能引入更多数据效率损失。nve 保持 <1.0× 确认 suppression 方向正确，\n      但效果量差异支持 \"directionally consistent\" 而非 \"replicated\" 的措辞。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Walker 008a vs Cheetah untrained dt_emb 的 normalized v/e 对比\"\n    analysis: |\n      C3 在 Cheetah 方向一致但效果量不同——与 median 档 \"environments_with_clean_replication: 1-2\"\n      一致（Walker 干净，Cheetah 有差异）。论文表述：\"Value growth suppression\n      from untrained dt_embedding is directionally consistent across environments\n      (nve < 1.0× in all seeds), though recovery magnitude differs with environment complexity.\"\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # 分析实验（0-1 GPU hours）\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"RSSM prediction quality: dt=1 vs dt=2 transitions\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_030\"\n    description: \"量化 RSSM fidelity gap 作为 CIVO 机制基础\"\n    expected_results:\n      baseline_dt1_obs_mse: 13.49\n      baseline_dt2_obs_mse: 27.50\n      baseline_obs_gap: 2.04\n      exp008d_dt1_obs_mse: 41.31\n      exp008d_dt2_obs_mse: 53.67\n      exp008d_obs_gap: 1.30\n      exp008d_dt1_obs_mse_vs_baseline: \"3.06×\"\n      exp008f_dt1_obs_mse: 8.01\n      exp008f_dt2_obs_mse: 22.04\n      exp008f_obs_gap: 2.75\n      exp008d_reward_gap: 2.78\n      exp008f_reward_gap: 1.01\n    result_rationale: |\n      RSSM fidelity analysis 已完成。关键发现：008d 的低 obs gap ratio (1.30×)\n      具有误导性——其 dt=1 绝对误差 41.31 已是 baseline 3×（模型整体已退化）。\n      008d 的 reward gap 2.78× 意味着 dt=2 reward 预测系统性偏差，\n      这直接导致 critic 在 dt>1 imagination steps 获得错误 value targets。\n      008f reward gap 1.01× 表明没有 dt_embedding 时 reward head 无法\n      区分 dt=1/dt=2（reward 预测都很差但均匀差），消除了系统性偏差。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"RSSM Fidelity Table（论文 Table 1）\"\n        rows:\n          - model: \"baseline\"\n            dt1_obs_MSE: 13.49\n            dt2_obs_MSE: 27.50\n            obs_gap: \"2.04×\"\n            dt1_reward_MAE: 0.0102\n            dt2_reward_MAE: 0.0159\n            reward_gap: \"1.56×\"\n          - model: \"008d (trained dt_emb)\"\n            dt1_obs_MSE: 41.31\n            dt2_obs_MSE: 53.67\n            obs_gap: \"1.30×\"\n            dt1_reward_MAE: 0.0568\n            dt2_reward_MAE: 0.1579\n            reward_gap: \"2.78×\"\n          - model: \"008f (no dt_emb)\"\n            dt1_obs_MSE: 8.01\n            dt2_obs_MSE: 22.04\n            obs_gap: \"2.75×\"\n            dt1_reward_MAE: 0.7469\n            dt2_reward_MAE: 0.7526\n            reward_gap: \"1.01×\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"双轴柱状图：绝对误差（左轴）+ gap ratio（右轴），三模型并排\"\n    analysis: |\n      论文必须同时报告绝对误差和比率，避免 008d 的低 obs gap ratio (1.30×)\n      误导审稿人认为 \"trained dt_emb 改善了 dt=2 预测\"——实际上是 dt=1\n      也变差了。核心证据链：trained dt_emb + RSSM fidelity gap → dt=2\n      reward 系统性偏差 → critic 在 imagination 中积累错误 value → CIVO。\n\n  - name: \"Actor entropy analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_031\"\n    description: \"健康 vs 崩溃配置的 actor entropy 动力学\"\n    expected_results:\n      collapsed_008d_s0_entropy_55K: -4.88\n      collapsed_008d_s0_entropy_trend: \"monotonic decrease → exploitation\"\n      healthy_008a_s0_entropy_105K: -4.2\n      healthy_008a_s0_entropy_trend: \"stable after initial decrease\"\n      pathway_b_008e_v3_s2_entropy_95K: -4.53\n      pathway_b_008e_v3_s2_entropy_105K: -3.83\n      pathway_b_entropy_trend: \"decrease then INCREASE at collapse\"\n      baseline_entropy_105K: -5.0\n      baseline_entropy_trend: \"monotonic decrease then stable ~-5.0\"\n    result_rationale: |\n      Entropy 动力学是区分 Pathway A（CIVO）和 Pathway B（non-CIVO）的关键。\n      Pathway A（008d）：entropy 持续下降（actor 变得越来越确定，exploitation\n      被错误 critic 驱动向错误方向）→ 这是经典 value overestimation 签名。\n      Pathway B（008e_v3_s2）：entropy 先正常下降后在崩溃前上升（-5.21→-3.83），\n      表明 actor 变得不确定/随机 → 这是 policy destabilization 而非 exploitation。\n      健康配置（008a）：entropy 正常下降后稳定，无异常。\n      这个分析 0 GPU cost，直接从 metrics.jsonl 提取。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Entropy signature by collapse pathway\"\n        rows:\n          - pathway: \"Healthy (008a, baseline)\"\n            entropy_pattern: \"↓ then stable\"\n            late_training_entropy: \"-4.2 to -5.0\"\n          - pathway: \"Pathway A / CIVO (008d)\"\n            entropy_pattern: \"↓↓ monotonic\"\n            late_training_entropy: \"-4.88 (exploitation)\"\n          - pathway: \"Pathway B / non-CIVO (008e_v3_s2)\"\n            entropy_pattern: \"↓ then ↑\"\n            late_training_entropy: \"-3.83 (destabilization)\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Actor entropy vs training step，4 配置叠加，标注崩溃 onset\"\n    analysis: |\n      Entropy 分析为 dual-pathway 论证提供独立支持证据。\n      可直接用作论文 Figure（或 appendix figure）区分两种崩溃机制。\n\n  - name: \"Value prediction distribution vs realized returns\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_032\"\n    description: \"V(s) vs Monte Carlo return 分布对比\"\n    expected_results:\n      trained_dt_emb_dt2_value_mean: 97.5\n      trained_dt_emb_dt2_mc_return_mean: 55\n      trained_dt_emb_dt2_overestimation_gap: \"+77%\"\n      trained_dt_emb_dt1_value_mean: 60\n      trained_dt_emb_dt1_mc_return_mean: 58\n      trained_dt_emb_dt1_gap: \"+3%\"\n      untrained_dt_emb_dt2_value_mean: 50\n      untrained_dt_emb_dt2_mc_return_mean: 52\n      untrained_dt_emb_dt2_gap: \"-4%\"\n      overlap_coefficient: 0.35\n    result_rationale: |\n      分布分析比标量 v/e 更 informative——能直接展示 trained dt_emb 在 dt=2\n      transitions 上的系统性右偏。预期 trained dt_emb 的 dt=2 value 分布\n      明显右移（overestimate ~77%），但存在重叠区域（overlap coefficient ~0.35），\n      使得分析不如 best-case 干净。dt=1 transitions 在所有配置下大致校准（gap <5%），\n      确认过高估仅在 dt>1 触发。untrained dt_emb 的 dt=2 value 轻微低估（-4%），\n      与 nve<1.0× 一致。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description:\n      - \"核密度图：V(s) vs MC return，训练/未训练 dt_emb × dt=1/dt=2 四面板\"\n    analysis: |\n      分布分析强化 C2 但因重叠区域存在，证据强度为 moderate 而非 strong。\n      论文中可放 appendix。\n\n  - name: \"dt_embedding cosine similarity analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_033\"\n    description: \"训练过程中 dt=1 和 dt=2 embedding 向量的相似度演化\"\n    expected_results:\n      cosine_sim_init: 0.92\n      cosine_sim_25K: 0.65\n      cosine_sim_55K: 0.40\n      cosine_sim_105K: 0.32\n      frozen_cosine_sim: 0.91\n      l2_distance_growth: \"monotonic increase from 0.3 to 2.1\"\n    result_rationale: |\n      Trained dt_emb 的 dt=1 和 dt=2 embedding 在训练中逐渐分化（cosine similarity\n      从 ~0.92 降至 ~0.32），表明网络学会了区分不同 temporal scales。\n      这个分化本身是正确的学习行为——问题在于 RSSM 的预测质量不支持\n      这种区分精度。在 frozen 配置中 cosine similarity 保持固定（~0.91），\n      确认分化是 training-driven。分析有趣但不是核心诊断指标，放 appendix。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Cosine similarity vs training step，叠加 trained/frozen/untrained 配置\"\n    analysis: |\n      Supplementary evidence：dt_emb 确实学习了 temporal discrimination，\n      但这反而成了问题——越精确的 dt conditioning + 越不精确的 RSSM =\n      越严重的 CIVO。放 appendix。\n\n  - name: \"NVE threshold sensitivity analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_034\"\n    description: \"0 GPU cost——从已有指标计算不同阈值的分类精度\"\n    expected_results:\n      threshold_1_3x:\n        accuracy: 0.71\n        false_positives: 2\n        false_negatives: 0\n        note: \"009c nve=1.14 和 Cheetah control 部分 seed 的 transient exceedance\"\n      threshold_1_5x:\n        accuracy: 0.83\n        false_positives: 1\n        false_negatives: 0\n        note: \"Cheetah control seed 2 nve peak 1.75× 是唯一 borderline case\"\n      threshold_1_7x:\n        accuracy: 0.92\n        false_positives: 0\n        false_negatives: 0\n        note: \"all trained seeds exceed; no control seeds exceed\"\n      threshold_2_0x:\n        accuracy: 0.92\n        false_positives: 0\n        false_negatives: 1\n        note: \"009b peak nve=2.05× 仅在 25K (unreliable timepoint)\"\n      auroc: 0.88\n      optimal_threshold: 1.7\n      recommended_threshold: 1.5\n      recommended_threshold_note: \"1.5× 更保守，更适合诊断预警\"\n      sample_size: \"~12 data points (6 trained, 6 control across 2 environments)\"\n    result_rationale: |\n      Median 档核心预测：nve_threshold_classification_accuracy 在 0.75-0.90。\n      1.5× 阈值精度 ~83%（6/7 或类似）因 Cheetah control 出现 1 个 borderline case。\n      这是 median 与 best-case 的关键差异——best-case 中 Walker 4/4 完美分类\n      扩展到跨环境仍然完美。AUROC ~0.88 仍然表明 NVE 是有意义的诊断指标，\n      但不再是 \"perfect separator\"。1.7× 阈值实现 0/0 error 但丧失了对\n      transient overestimation 的早期预警能力。论文推荐 1.5× 并注明\n      环境敏感性。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"NVE threshold classification performance\"\n        rows:\n          - threshold: \"1.3×\"\n            accuracy: \"71% (5/7)\"\n            sensitivity: \"100%\"\n            specificity: \"67%\"\n          - threshold: \"1.5×\"\n            accuracy: \"83% (5/6)\"\n            sensitivity: \"100%\"\n            specificity: \"83%\"\n          - threshold: \"1.7×\"\n            accuracy: \"92%\"\n            sensitivity: \"100%\"\n            specificity: \"100%\"\n          - threshold: \"2.0×\"\n            accuracy: \"92%\"\n            sensitivity: \"83%\"\n            specificity: \"100%\"\n      - title: \"Bootstrap CI for trained vs control Δ NVE\"\n        rows:\n          - metric: \"Mean Δ NVE (trained - control)\"\n            value: \"+2.1\"\n            ci_95: \"[+0.5, +3.2]\"\n          - metric: \"Exceedance probability P(trained > control)\"\n            value: \"90%\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"ROC 曲线：NVE 阈值对 CIVO/non-CIVO 的分类性能\"\n      - \"Threshold sensitivity 柱状图：accuracy vs threshold level\"\n    analysis: |\n      NVE 1.5× 阈值从 \"perfect separator\" 降级为 \"strong but imperfect diagnostic\"。\n      论文措辞需要调整：从 \"4/4 perfect classification\" 到 \"83-92% classification\n      accuracy depending on threshold, with one borderline control case in\n      Cheetah Run.\" Bootstrap CI lower bound = 0.5（在 median 档的 0.1-0.9 范围内），\n      exceedance probability = 90%（在 80-95% 范围内）。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # Cartpole Swingup（来不及完成）\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"Cartpole Swingup baseline (3 seeds)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_050\"\n    description: \"第三环境 dt=1 baseline\"\n    expected_results:\n      status: \"NOT_COMPLETED_BEFORE_DEADLINE\"\n      estimated_baseline_if_run: \"~800-860 (DreamerV3 typical)\"\n      gpu_hours_needed: 15\n      reason_skipped: \"GPU budget 和 deadline 限制\"\n    result_rationale: |\n      Median 档核心假设之一：\"Cartpole 实验来不及完成（仅 2 环境）\"。\n      CoRL 2026-05-29 deadline 前 GPU 预算不足以完成 3 个 Cartpole 配置\n      × 3 seeds。论文以 Walker + Cheetah 两环境提交。\n      Reviewers 可能质疑仅 2 环境的泛化性——rebuttal 中承诺提供 Cartpole 数据。\n      这是 median 档与 best-case 的第二大差异（best-case 有 3 环境）。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: |\n      论文 limitations 需明确声明：\"Results are demonstrated in two DMC\n      locomotion environments (Walker Walk, Cheetah Run). Generalization to\n      non-locomotion tasks requires further investigation.\"\n\n  - name: \"Cartpole Swingup trained dt_emb + subsample ON (3 seeds)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_051\"\n    description: \"Cartpole CIVO 触发\"\n    expected_results:\n      status: \"NOT_COMPLETED_BEFORE_DEADLINE\"\n    result_rationale: \"依赖 plan_050 baseline，无法在 deadline 前完成。\"\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"跳过，与 plan_050 相同原因。\"\n\n  - name: \"Cartpole Swingup dt_embed_dim=0 + subsample ON (3 seeds)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_052\"\n    description: \"Cartpole 因果控制\"\n    expected_results:\n      status: \"NOT_COMPLETED_BEFORE_DEADLINE\"\n    result_rationale: \"依赖 plan_050 baseline，无法在 deadline 前完成。\"\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"跳过，与 plan_050 相同原因。\"\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # 进阶实验\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"Uncertainty-gated imagination truncation pilot\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_060\"\n    description: \"基于 RSSM 预测不确定性截断 imagination rollout\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_105K: 580\n      vs_baseline: \"-37%\"\n      nve_peak: 1.3\n      collapse: false\n      collapse_rate_if_multi_seed: \"~25% (1/4 estimate)\"\n      truncation_rate_avg: \"40% of dt=2 steps truncated\"\n      effective_horizon: \"~11 steps (vs H=15 nominal)\"\n    result_rationale: |\n      Uncertainty-gated truncation 在 RSSM 预测不确定性超过阈值时截断 imagination。\n      Median 档预期：方法在单 seed 试点中表现有希望（无崩溃，nve<1.5×），\n      但性能恢复有限（仅 ~63% baseline），因为 truncation 过于激进\n      （40% dt=2 步被截断，effective horizon 缩短至 11 步）。\n      这说明 truncation 地址了 Pathway A 但可能引入新的性能限制。\n      作为 Discussion 中的 future work 方向有价值，但作为独立 contribution 不足。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Truncation rate vs training step 叠加 NVE 曲线\"\n    analysis: |\n      Pilot 结果可放 appendix 或 Discussion 的 future work 段。\n      不足以作为论文的 mitigation contribution（那需要多 seed + 跨环境验证）。\n\n  - name: \"Hopper Hop validation (3 seeds × 3 configs)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_040\"\n    description: \"第三环境（非提交优先级）\"\n    expected_results:\n      status: \"NOT_COMPLETED_BEFORE_DEADLINE\"\n      gpu_hours_needed: 45\n    result_rationale: |\n      P2 优先级 + 45 GPU hours 需求，在 CoRL deadline 前不可行。\n      即使 Cartpole 完成，Hopper 也超出预算。留作后续工作。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"P2 实验，不影响当前提交。\"\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # 衍生分析（非 plan 但影响 median 定义）\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"008f_s3 borderline NVE (registry: exp_008f_s3_no_dt_embed_walker)\"\n    plan_id: \"registry_only\"\n    description: \"Walker Walk 008f 第 3 个 seed——median 档 borderline case\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_105K: 250\n      nve_peak: 1.42\n      nve_peak_step: 85000\n      nve_105K: 1.10\n      collapse: false\n      borderline_for_threshold: true\n    result_rationale: |\n      Median 档核心假设：'008f_s3 NVE 在 1.2-1.6×（borderline，削弱 threshold 完美分类）'。\n      seed 0 nve peak=1.02, seed 1 nve peak=1.05, seed 2 (009c) nve peak=1.26。\n      seed 3 预期 nve peak ~1.42×，接近但未超过 1.5× 阈值。如果 Cheetah control\n      没有提供 borderline case，008f_s3 就是削弱分类精度的数据点。\n      即使 nve peak <1.5×，其值（1.42×）足够高以引起审稿人对阈值鲁棒性的质疑。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: |\n      008f_s3 + Cheetah control seed 2 合计提供 1-2 个 borderline cases，\n      将 NVE 1.5× 阈值精度从 perfect 降至 ~83%。\n\n  - name: \"018v2 Full-SGS 确认分析 (registry: exp_018v2_full_sgs_walker_s1)\"\n    plan_id: \"registry_only\"\n    description: \"Full-SGS 消除 CIVO 但不恢复性能\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_105K: 448\n      vs_baseline: \"49% (448/916)\"\n      nve_sustained: 1.05\n      nve_peak: 1.25\n      civo_eliminated: true\n      performance_recovery: \"partial (49%)\"\n      civo_independent_contribution_pp: 28\n    result_rationale: |\n      Median 档预期 full_sgs_018v2_nve_sustained 在 0.8-1.3× 区间，\n      eval 仅恢复到 ~49% baseline。018v2 通过 Full-SGS（移除 observation\n      decoder 对 dt_emb 的 93% 梯度通路）消除 CIVO（nve ≤ 1.25×），\n      但性能仅恢复到 448（vs 008d 崩溃至 131，baseline 916）。\n      CIVO 独立贡献 = 008d@105K baseline ratio - 018v2@105K baseline ratio\n      = (916-131)/916 - (916-448)/916 ≈ 86% - 51% = 35pp（上界）。\n      但 median 档承认 inherent multi-dt cost confound：018v2 的 49%\n      恢复意味着至少 51% 的退化来自 inherent cost（非 CIVO 因素），\n      使 CIVO 独立贡献的下界为 ~20pp。范围：20-35pp。\n      Sensitivity analysis 展示不同分解假设下的结果。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"CIVO decomposition sensitivity analysis\"\n        rows:\n          - assumption: \"Upper bound: all 008d-018v2 gap = CIVO\"\n            civo_pp: 35\n            inherent_cost_pp: 51\n          - assumption: \"Mid estimate: 018v2 inherent cost = 008a inherent cost\"\n            civo_pp: 28\n            inherent_cost_pp: 58\n          - assumption: \"Lower bound: inherent cost dominant\"\n            civo_pp: 20\n            inherent_cost_pp: 66\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Stacked bar chart: baseline performance decomposed into retained + inherent cost + CIVO contribution\"\n    analysis: |\n      CIVO 独立贡献 20-35pp 是 median 档的核心量化发现。\n      论文措辞从 \"35pp independent contribution\" 改为 \"20-35pp range,\n      with the upper bound limited by potential confounding from inherent\n      multi-dt training cost.\" Sensitivity analysis 是必须的附加材料。\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":41613,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":41613},"output_tokens":22,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4712391e-8d6d-4492-afa6-ac943e7a7e9a","uuid":"aac5bdb7-fbfe-4d89-b985-e4c26156003d"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":471994,"duration_api_ms":473990,"num_turns":1,"result":"```yaml\ntier: median\nnarrative_guidance: |\n  核心因果方向（trained dt_emb → CIVO → collapse risk）跨 Walker 和 Cheetah 成立，\n  但边界不如 best-case 干净。三个关键软化点：\n  (1) NVE 1.5× 阈值分类精度降至 ~83%（6/7），因 008f_s3 或 Cheetah 控制出现 1 个 borderline case；\n  (2) Cheetah 控制实验 NVE 峰值在 1.3-2.0× 区间（方向正确但不如 Walker 的 <1.3× 干净），\n      削弱 \"eliminates\" 措辞 → 改为 \"significantly reduces\"；\n  (3) CIVO 独立贡献从 \"35pp\" 降为 \"20-35pp range\"，需 sensitivity analysis 展示\n      different decomposition assumptions 的影响；\n  (4) 跨环境叙事从 \"replicated\" 改为 \"directionally consistent\"；\n  (5) Cartpole 来不及完成，论文只有 2 个环境。\n  仍可投 CoRL，但 rebuttal 需准备额外 seed 或 Cartpole 数据。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  # ============================================================\n  # Walker Walk 多 seed 复制\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"Walker Walk 008d (trained dt_emb, collapse) seeds 1-2\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_011\"\n    description: \"2 额外 seed 复制 CIVO 崩溃\"\n    expected_results:\n      seed1_009e_eval_105K: 131\n      seed1_009e_nve_peak: 4.12\n      seed1_009e_nve_peak_step: 55000\n      seed1_009e_collapse: true\n      seed1_009e_nve_sustained_above_1_5x: true\n      seed2_009b_eval_105K: 268\n      seed2_009b_nve_peak: 2.05\n      seed2_009b_nve_peak_step: 25000\n      seed2_009b_collapse: false\n      seed2_009b_self_corrected: true\n      seed2_009b_nve_105K: 0.38\n      collapse_rate_across_seeds: \"1/2 (50%)\"\n      nve_exceeds_1_5x_rate: \"2/2 (100%)\"\n    result_rationale: |\n      Median 档预期 walker_trained_dt_emb_collapse_rate 在 0.25-0.75 区间。\n      50% 崩溃率（1/2 独立 seed）落在区间中心。两个 seed 都超过 nve>1.5×，\n      确认 trained dt_emb 可靠触发病理性高估，但是否级联为崩溃取决于\n      早期训练随机性（初始化 + 数据采样顺序）。seed 1 的 nve 在 35K+ 连续\n      3 个 checkpoint 维持 >1.5×（1.71→2.09→4.12），锁定正反馈环；\n      seed 2 的 nve 在 45K 短暂达 1.62× 后立即回落至 1.41×，自校正力\n      在反馈环锁定前占据主导。这与 Henderson et al. (2018) 关于 RL\n      结果高方差的文献一致——崩溃是随机的，但诊断标记（nve>1.5×）是确定性的。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"008d cross-seed NVE trajectory (35K+)\"\n        rows:\n          - seed: 0 (008d)\n            nve_35K: 1.71\n            nve_45K: 2.09\n            nve_55K: 4.12\n            outcome: \"COLLAPSE\"\n          - seed: 1 (009e)\n            nve_35K: 1.71\n            nve_45K: 2.09\n            nve_55K: 4.12\n            outcome: \"COLLAPSE\"\n          - seed: 2 (009b)\n            nve_25K: 2.05\n            nve_45K: 1.62\n            nve_55K: 1.41\n            nve_105K: 0.38\n            outcome: \"SELF-CORRECTED\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"NVE 时间序列（3 seeds 叠加），标注 1.5× 阈值线和崩溃/自校正区域\"\n    analysis: |\n      C2 因果方向在 Walker Walk 跨 seed 得到确认：所有 trained dt_emb seed 均触发\n      nve>1.5×（3/3 counting seed 0），崩溃率 ~50%（2/3 counting seed 0）。\n      seed 0 和 seed 1 共享 seed=1 故只计 1 个独立观测，独立崩溃率 1/2。\n      关键洞察：nve>1.5× 是必要但非充分的崩溃条件——temporal persistence 是第二道门。\n\n  - name: \"Walker Walk 008f (dt_embed_dim=0) seeds 1-2\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_012\"\n    description: \"2 额外 seed 复制因果控制稳定性\"\n    expected_results:\n      seed1_009f_eval_105K: 380\n      seed1_009f_nve_peak: 1.05\n      seed1_009f_nve_105K: 0.35\n      seed1_009f_collapse: false\n      seed1_009f_trajectory: \"zigzag recovery, 173→375→290→380\"\n      seed2_009c_eval_105K: 148\n      seed2_009c_nve_peak: 1.26\n      seed2_009c_nve_105K: 1.14\n      seed2_009c_collapse: false\n      seed2_009c_trajectory: \"peak 359@75K then monotonic decline\"\n      cross_seed_nve_below_1_5x: \"2/2\"\n      cross_seed_eval_variance: \"high (148-503 at 105K across 3 seeds)\"\n    result_rationale: |\n      Median 档中 008f 的保护方向成立（nve 均未超 1.5×），但跨 seed 一致性差。\n      seed 2 (009c) 出现 75K 后持续下降而非 seed 0 的 zigzag 恢复，nve 从 0.33@75K\n      上升至 1.14@105K，逼近但未突破 1.5× 阈值。seed 1 (009f) 的恢复比 seed 0\n      弱但保持稳定。高 eval 方差（3 seeds: 503, 380, 148）说明 dt_embed_dim=0\n      虽然阻断 CIVO 但引入了自身的不稳定性（reward_MAE = 0.747, baseline 75×），\n      并非推荐方案。这支持 paper 中 008f 定位为因果控制而非实用缓解的叙事。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"008f cross-seed summary at 105K\"\n        rows:\n          - seed: 0 (008f)\n            eval_105K: 503\n            nve_105K: 0.30\n            nve_peak: 1.02\n            trend: \"zigzag recovery ↑\"\n          - seed: 1 (009f)\n            eval_105K: 380\n            nve_105K: 0.35\n            nve_peak: 1.05\n            trend: \"moderate recovery\"\n          - seed: 2 (009c)\n            eval_105K: 148\n            nve_105K: 1.14\n            nve_peak: 1.26\n            trend: \"decline after 75K\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"008f 3-seed eval 学习曲线 + 阴影 IQR，对比 008d 3-seed\"\n    analysis: |\n      008f 因果控制结论成立但不如 best-case 干净。所有 seed nve<1.5×（3/3），\n      但 009c nve=1.14@105K 且仍在上升，若延长至 200K 可能接近阈值。\n      关键：009c 的 performance decline 不是 CIVO（value 没有爆炸），\n      而是 reward prediction 噪声导致的 critic 质量退化——这正是 008f\n      去掉 dt_embedding 的副作用。论文中需明确区分因果控制（成功）\n      和性能恢复（不成功）。\n\n  - name: \"Walker Walk 008a (untrained dt_emb) seeds 1-2\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_013\"\n    description: \"2 额外 seed 复制 value growth suppression\"\n    expected_results:\n      seed1_eval_105K: 680\n      seed1_nve_range: \"0.55-0.85\"\n      seed1_nve_105K: 0.65\n      seed1_recovery_pattern: \"single V-recovery, less pronounced than seed 0\"\n      seed1_collapse: false\n      seed2_eval_105K: 550\n      seed2_nve_range: \"0.60-0.95\"\n      seed2_nve_105K: 0.78\n      seed2_recovery_pattern: \"gradual rise without clear V-shape\"\n      seed2_collapse: false\n      cross_seed_mean_eval_105K: 669\n      cross_seed_vs_baseline_105K: \"-27%\"\n      cross_seed_nve_all_below_1x: \"partial — seed 2 briefly touches 0.95x\"\n    result_rationale: |\n      Median 档中 008a 的 value suppression 方向一致但效果量跨 seed 有差异。\n      seed 0 达到 778@105K（85% baseline），但额外 seed 预期稍弱（680, 550），\n      因为 zigzag recovery 的恢复幅度依赖训练随机性。seed 2 可能更慢恢复，\n      105K 时仅达 ~60% baseline。关键指标 nve 在所有 seed 保持 <1.0×，\n      确认 value growth suppression 是结构性的（untrained dt_emb 阻止 value\n      利用 dt 信息），但绝对性能差异大于 seed 0 报告值。\n      论文中报告 IQM 时需包含这个方差。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"008a cross-seed V-recovery comparison\"\n        rows:\n          - seed: 0\n            eval_55K: 488\n            eval_75K: 470\n            eval_105K: 778\n            nve_105K: 0.59\n            recovery_cycles: 2\n          - seed: 1\n            eval_55K: 420\n            eval_75K: 520\n            eval_105K: 680\n            nve_105K: 0.65\n            recovery_cycles: 1\n          - seed: 2\n            eval_55K: 350\n            eval_75K: 400\n            eval_105K: 550\n            nve_105K: 0.78\n            recovery_cycles: 0\n    figures_description:\n      - \"008a 3-seed eval 曲线对比 baseline 3-seed，展示 value suppression 效果的跨 seed 方差\"\n    analysis: |\n      C3 方向一致但 seed 间效果量差异显著（778 vs 550 at 105K）。\n      IQM = ~669，约 73% baseline。论文措辞应为 \"untrained dt_emb provides\n      directionally consistent value suppression (nve 0.55-0.95× across all seeds)\n      and prevents catastrophic collapse, but absolute recovery varies substantially\"。\n\n  - name: \"Walker Walk 008e_v3 (dt=1 imagination) seeds 1-2\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_014\"\n    description: \"多 seed 验证 dt=1 imagination 作为缓解策略\"\n    expected_results:\n      seed1_eval_105K: 870\n      seed1_nve_105K: 0.80\n      seed1_collapse: false\n      seed1_vs_baseline: \"-5%\"\n      seed2_eval_105K: 137\n      seed2_nve_105K: 3.78\n      seed2_collapse: true\n      seed2_collapse_onset: 95000\n      seed2_collapse_mechanism: \"non-CIVO (eval-driven, entropy ↑)\"\n      seed2_actor_entropy_at_collapse: -3.83\n      collapse_rate: \"1/2 (50%)\"\n      gate_dt_mean_both_seeds: 1.0\n    result_rationale: |\n      Median 档中 C6 部分否证是核心发现之一。seed 1 健康（95% baseline），\n      seed 2 崩溃但机制与经典 CIVO 不同：008d 崩溃时 value 爆炸 + entropy ↓\n      （actor exploit 错误 critic），008e_v3_s2 崩溃时 eval 先跌 + entropy ↑\n      （policy destabilization）。gate_dt=1.0 贯穿始终证明崩溃并非 dt>1\n      imagination 引起。009a baseline s2 在同期完全稳定（618→596→837），\n      排除 seed 2 本身脆弱的假说。这意味着 trained dt_embedding 的风险\n      不仅仅是 CIVO：即使 imagination 全部用 dt=1，训练数据中的 dt>1\n      transitions + trained dt_emb 就足以创造另一条脆弱性通路（Pathway B）。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"008e_v3 collapse pathway comparison\"\n        rows:\n          - feature: \"value 变化\"\n            008d_s1_CIVO: \"爆炸 (+130%)\"\n            008e_v3_s2_PathwayB: \"温和 (+13%→-12%)\"\n          - feature: \"eval 变化\"\n            008d_s1_CIVO: \"后跌 (-43%)\"\n            008e_v3_s2_PathwayB: \"先跌 (-81%)\"\n          - feature: \"nve 驱动\"\n            008d_s1_CIVO: \"value 分子驱动\"\n            008e_v3_s2_PathwayB: \"eval 分母驱动\"\n          - feature: \"actor_entropy\"\n            008d_s1_CIVO: \"↓ (-3.47→-4.88)\"\n            008e_v3_s2_PathwayB: \"↑ (-5.21→-3.83)\"\n          - feature: \"机制\"\n            008d_s1_CIVO: \"critic overestimate → actor exploit\"\n            008e_v3_s2_PathwayB: \"eval crash → value 滞后\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"008e_v3 seed 1 vs seed 2 的 eval/value/entropy 三指标对比面板\"\n      - \"Pathway A (CIVO) vs Pathway B (non-CIVO) 的因果图\"\n    analysis: |\n      C6 从 \"dt=1 imagination = mitigation\" 修正为 \"trained dt_embedding creates\n      vulnerability through multiple pathways\"。dt=1 消除 Pathway A（CIVO）\n      但不消除 Pathway B（policy instability）。崩溃率 50% 与 008d 相同，\n      意味着 dt=1 imagination 未降低崩溃概率。论文 Discussion 中应将此\n      作为关键发现：根本脆弱性在于 trained dt_embedding 本身，不在 imagination dt。\n\n  - name: \"Walker Walk FROZEN dt_emb + subsample ON + dt=2 imag + H=8\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_015\"\n    description: \"Frozen dt_embedding（requires_grad=False）诊断 training 是否为 CIVO 必要条件\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_105K: 204\n      nve_range: \"0.39-0.47\"\n      nve_105K: 0.42\n      collapse: false\n      civo_detected: false\n      actor_loss_105K: 0.000179\n      actor_entropy_105K: -4.855\n      gate_dt_mean: 2.0\n      gradient_starvation_detected: true\n      eval_trajectory: \"volatile 80-238, no convergence\"\n    result_rationale: |\n      Frozen dt_emb 提供随机固定的 temporal conditioning，RSSM 无法通过\n      梯度学习利用它。结果：(1) nve 远低于 1.0×（critic 系统性低估而非高估），\n      不触发 CIVO；(2) actor_loss→0 表明梯度饥饿——frozen random embeddings\n      在 state space 中引入不可学习的噪声维度，actor 无法从 critic\n      获得有意义的策略梯度；(3) 性能极不稳定（80-238），无法收敛。\n      与 008d（trained dt_emb, 崩溃）对比确认：dt_emb 的 TRAINING\n      是 CIVO 的必要条件。frozen dt_emb 不触发 CIVO 但也不提供任何\n      有用信息，造成学习退化。这完善了 2×2 消融矩阵：\n      trained+exposed=CIVO, trained+unexposed=value suppression,\n      frozen=gradient starvation, absent=reward degradation。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"dt_emb 状态 × CIVO outcome 消融矩阵\"\n        rows:\n          - dt_emb: \"trained + exposed (008d)\"\n            nve_regime: \">1.5× (CIVO)\"\n            eval_105K: 131\n            mechanism: \"value explosion\"\n          - dt_emb: \"trained + unexposed (008a)\"\n            nve_regime: \"<1.0× (suppressed)\"\n            eval_105K: 778\n            mechanism: \"value growth suppression\"\n          - dt_emb: \"frozen random (015b)\"\n            nve_regime: \"<0.5× (starved)\"\n            eval_105K: 204\n            mechanism: \"gradient starvation\"\n          - dt_emb: \"absent (008f)\"\n            nve_regime: \"<1.0× (stable)\"\n            eval_105K: 503\n            mechanism: \"reward degradation\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"2×2 消融矩阵热力图：行=dt_emb state, 列=key metric (nve, eval)\"\n    analysis: |\n      015b 确认 dt_emb training 是 CIVO 的必要条件。frozen random embedding\n      创造了一种独特的失败模式（gradient starvation），与 CIVO（value explosion）\n      和 reward degradation（008f）都不同。论文中可在 Table 形式呈现完整消融矩阵。\n\n  - name: \"Walker Walk 008e_v3 additional seeds (3-4)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_016\"\n    description: \"缩窄 008e_v3 崩溃概率估计\"\n    expected_results:\n      seed3_eval_105K: 145\n      seed3_collapse: true\n      seed3_collapse_onset: 90000\n      seed3_nve_105K: 2.90\n      seed3_collapse_mechanism: \"non-CIVO pathway B (entropy ↑)\"\n      seed4_eval_105K: 820\n      seed4_collapse: false\n      seed4_nve_105K: 0.75\n      seed4_vs_baseline: \"-10%\"\n      cumulative_collapse_rate: \"2/4 (50%)\"\n      collapse_pathway_distribution: \"0/2 CIVO (Pathway A), 2/2 non-CIVO (Pathway B)\"\n    result_rationale: |\n      Median 档预期 008e_v3 崩溃率维持 ~50%（walker_trained_dt_emb_collapse_rate\n      区间 0.25-0.75 的中位值）。4 个独立 seed 中 2 个崩溃（seed 2 和 seed 3），\n      2 个健康（seed 1 和 seed 4），与 008d（dt=2 imagination）的 50% 崩溃率\n      一致。这强化了 C6 否证：dt=1 imagination 未降低崩溃概率。\n      所有 008e_v3 崩溃 seed 均展示 Pathway B 动力学（eval-driven, entropy ↑），\n      不同于 008d 的 Pathway A（value-driven, entropy ↓），确认 dt=1 imagination\n      确实消除了 CIVO 但 Pathway B 的崩溃率填补了空缺。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"008e_v3 4-seed collapse summary\"\n        rows:\n          - seed: 1\n            eval_105K: 870\n            nve_105K: 0.80\n            collapsed: \"No\"\n          - seed: 2\n            eval_105K: 137\n            nve_105K: 3.78\n            collapsed: \"Yes (Pathway B)\"\n          - seed: 3\n            eval_105K: 145\n            nve_105K: 2.90\n            collapsed: \"Yes (Pathway B)\"\n          - seed: 4\n            eval_105K: 820\n            nve_105K: 0.75\n            collapsed: \"No\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"008e_v3 4-seed eval 曲线面板，崩溃 seed 用红色标注\"\n    analysis: |\n      50% 崩溃率 + 纯 Pathway B 崩溃确认：trained dt_emb 的风险是多通路的。\n      论文措辞：\"dt=1 imagination eliminates the CIVO feedback loop (Pathway A)\n      but does not reduce overall collapse probability; a distinct instability\n      pathway (Pathway B) manifests at the same rate.\"\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # Cheetah Run 跨环境验证\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"Cheetah Run baseline (3 seeds)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_020\"\n    description: \"Cheetah Run dt=1 baseline\"\n    expected_results:\n      seed0_eval_peak: 850\n      seed0_eval_last10_mean: 820\n      seed1_eval_peak: 810\n      seed1_eval_last10_mean: 780\n      seed2_eval_peak: 830\n      seed2_eval_last10_mean: 800\n      cross_seed_iqm_peak: 830\n      cross_seed_iqm_last10: 800\n      ve_stable_range: \"0.65-0.75\"\n      convergence_step: \"~150K\"\n    result_rationale: |\n      Cheetah Run 是 DMC 标准环境，DreamerV3 在 500K steps 通常达到 ~800-850。\n      010a seed 1 已验证 849.8，额外 seed 预期在 780-830 范围，与 Walker Walk\n      baseline 稳定性一致。v/e 收敛至 0.65-0.75 区间提供跨环境 baseline\n      calibration。Cheetah 的 obs space 更大（velocity, position），可能\n      v/e 收敛略慢于 Walker。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Cheetah baseline key checkpoints\"\n        rows:\n          - metric: \"eval@105K (IQM)\"\n            value: \"~420\"\n          - metric: \"eval@205K (IQM)\"\n            value: \"~650\"\n          - metric: \"eval@505K (IQM)\"\n            value: \"~800\"\n          - metric: \"v/e stable\"\n            value: \"0.65-0.75 from ~200K\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Cheetah 3-seed baseline 学习曲线 + IQR 阴影\"\n    analysis: |\n      Cheetah baseline 建立后可用于计算 normalized v/e 和 CIVO trigger\n      对比。baseline 方差预计与 Walker 相当（seeds 间 ~5-8% 差异）。\n\n  - name: \"Cheetah Run trained dt_emb + subsample ON (3 seeds)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_021\"\n    description: \"Cheetah Run CIVO trigger 跨环境复制\"\n    expected_results:\n      seed0_eval_105K: 55\n      seed0_nve_peak: 14.6\n      seed0_collapse: true\n      seed0_collapse_onset: 55000\n      seed1_eval_105K: 120\n      seed1_nve_peak: 9.2\n      seed1_collapse: true\n      seed1_collapse_onset: 65000\n      seed2_eval_105K: 180\n      seed2_nve_peak: 6.8\n      seed2_collapse: false\n      seed2_nve_105K: 2.3\n      seed2_self_corrected: false\n      seed2_trajectory: \"partial decline, not full collapse\"\n      cross_seed_collapse_rate: \"2/3\"\n      cross_seed_nve_mean_peak: 10.2\n    result_rationale: |\n      Median 档预期 cheetah_civo_trigger_nve_peak 在 8-15×。010b seed 0\n      已显示 NVE 14.59× 和崩溃确认。额外 seed 预期展示 CIVO 但严重程度\n      有差异：seed 1 崩溃较温和（NVE 9.2×, 晚 onset），seed 2 可能仅\n      部分退化而非完全崩溃（NVE 6.8×, 位于区间低端），使跨环境叙事\n      从 \"replicated\" 降为 \"directionally consistent\"。Cheetah 的奖励\n      结构（前进速度主导）与 Walker（步态稳定主导）不同，可能使\n      CIVO 的表现形式有差异——Cheetah 的 reward 更连续，value 估计\n      可能有更多自校正机会。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Cheetah CIVO trigger cross-seed\"\n        rows:\n          - seed: 0 (010b)\n            nve_peak: 14.59\n            nve_peak_step: 65K\n            eval_105K: 52\n            outcome: \"COLLAPSE\"\n          - seed: 1\n            nve_peak: 9.2\n            nve_peak_step: 75K\n            eval_105K: 120\n            outcome: \"COLLAPSE\"\n          - seed: 2\n            nve_peak: 6.8\n            nve_peak_step: 55K\n            eval_105K: 180\n            outcome: \"PARTIAL DECLINE\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Cheetah CIVO trigger 3-seed NVE 曲线，标注 Walker 的 NVE 范围作为参考\"\n    analysis: |\n      CIVO 方向在 Cheetah 确认（3/3 seeds NVE >2×, 2/3 崩溃），但噪声大于 Walker。\n      seed 2 的 NVE 6.8× 仍远超健康范围但未触发完全崩溃，可能反映 Cheetah\n      reward landscape 的某些自校正属性。论文措辞：\"CIVO mechanism is directionally\n      consistent across environments, with quantitative differences in severity.\"\n\n  - name: \"Cheetah Run dt_embed_dim=0 + subsample ON (3 seeds)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_022\"\n    description: \"Cheetah Run 因果控制——关键 borderline 实验\"\n    expected_results:\n      seed0_eval_105K: 280\n      seed0_nve_peak: 1.45\n      seed0_nve_105K: 0.60\n      seed0_collapse: false\n      seed1_eval_105K: 320\n      seed1_nve_peak: 1.30\n      seed1_nve_105K: 0.50\n      seed1_collapse: false\n      seed2_eval_105K: 200\n      seed2_nve_peak: 1.75\n      seed2_nve_105K: 0.95\n      seed2_collapse: false\n      cross_seed_nve_all_below_2x: true\n      cross_seed_nve_borderline: \"seed 2 peak 1.75× (borderline for 1.5× threshold)\"\n    result_rationale: |\n      Median 档关键预测：cheetah_control_nve_peak 在 1.3-2.0× 区间。\n      这是 median 区别于 best-case 的核心——Walker 008f 的 control nve peak\n      仅 1.02-1.26×（远低于 1.5×），但 Cheetah 的 control 更嘈杂。\n      seed 2 nve peak 达 1.75×——超过 1.5× 阈值但低于 2.0×——这就是\n      那个 \"borderline case\" 削弱 threshold 分类完美性的来源。\n      原因在于 Cheetah 的 RSSM fidelity gap 可能天然更大（obs space 更丰富），\n      即使没有 trained dt_emb，dt=2 transitions 的 reward 预测噪声\n      也更严重，导致 v/e 比率在某些 seed 偶然偏高。\n      保护方向仍然正确（没有崩溃），但不再是 \"eliminates\" 而是 \"significantly reduces\"。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Cheetah control NVE peaks vs Walker control\"\n        rows:\n          - environment: \"Walker 008f s0\"\n            nve_peak: 1.02\n            threshold_violation: \"No\"\n          - environment: \"Walker 008f s1 (009f)\"\n            nve_peak: 1.05\n            threshold_violation: \"No\"\n          - environment: \"Walker 009c s2\"\n            nve_peak: 1.26\n            threshold_violation: \"No\"\n          - environment: \"Cheetah s0\"\n            nve_peak: 1.45\n            threshold_violation: \"No\"\n          - environment: \"Cheetah s1\"\n            nve_peak: 1.30\n            threshold_violation: \"No\"\n          - environment: \"Cheetah s2\"\n            nve_peak: 1.75\n            threshold_violation: \"YES (borderline)\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Control NVE peak 分布：Walker (3 seeds) vs Cheetah (3 seeds)，标注 1.5× 阈值\"\n    analysis: |\n      Cheetah control 的 seed 2 nve peak=1.75× 是 median 档的定义性事件。\n      它将 NVE 1.5× 阈值的分类精度从 perfect (6/6) 降至 5/6 ≈ 83%。\n      论文需承认：\"The 1.5× NVE threshold achieves ~83% classification accuracy\n      across environments; one control seed in Cheetah Run shows borderline\n      exceedance (1.75×) without performance collapse, indicating the threshold\n      is environment-sensitive.\" 但保护方向成立：所有 control seeds 无崩溃。\n\n  - name: \"Cheetah Run untrained dt_emb + no subsample (3 seeds)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_023\"\n    description: \"Cheetah Run value growth suppression 复制\"\n    expected_results:\n      seed0_eval_105K: 450\n      seed0_nve_range: \"0.50-0.85\"\n      seed0_nve_105K: 0.65\n      seed1_eval_105K: 380\n      seed1_nve_range: \"0.55-0.90\"\n      seed1_nve_105K: 0.75\n      seed2_eval_105K: 350\n      seed2_nve_range: \"0.60-0.95\"\n      seed2_nve_105K: 0.80\n      cross_seed_vs_baseline: \"-45% to -55%\"\n      cross_seed_nve_all_below_1x: true\n      recovery_pattern: \"directionally consistent but weaker than Walker\"\n    result_rationale: |\n      Untrained dt_emb 的 value suppression 机制是架构级的，应跨环境保持方向一致。\n      但 Cheetah 的绝对恢复程度预期弱于 Walker（Walker 008a@105K=778=85% baseline\n      vs Cheetah 预期 ~450=~53% baseline），因为 (1) Cheetah 的 action space\n      和 obs space 对 horizon 更敏感，(2) subsample OFF 配置在 Cheetah\n      中可能引入更多数据效率损失。nve 保持 <1.0× 确认 suppression 方向正确，\n      但效果量差异支持 \"directionally consistent\" 而非 \"replicated\" 的措辞。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Walker 008a vs Cheetah untrained dt_emb 的 normalized v/e 对比\"\n    analysis: |\n      C3 在 Cheetah 方向一致但效果量不同——与 median 档 \"environments_with_clean_replication: 1-2\"\n      一致（Walker 干净，Cheetah 有差异）。论文表述：\"Value growth suppression\n      from untrained dt_embedding is directionally consistent across environments\n      (nve < 1.0× in all seeds), though recovery magnitude differs with environment complexity.\"\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # 分析实验（0-1 GPU hours）\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"RSSM prediction quality: dt=1 vs dt=2 transitions\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_030\"\n    description: \"量化 RSSM fidelity gap 作为 CIVO 机制基础\"\n    expected_results:\n      baseline_dt1_obs_mse: 13.49\n      baseline_dt2_obs_mse: 27.50\n      baseline_obs_gap: 2.04\n      exp008d_dt1_obs_mse: 41.31\n      exp008d_dt2_obs_mse: 53.67\n      exp008d_obs_gap: 1.30\n      exp008d_dt1_obs_mse_vs_baseline: \"3.06×\"\n      exp008f_dt1_obs_mse: 8.01\n      exp008f_dt2_obs_mse: 22.04\n      exp008f_obs_gap: 2.75\n      exp008d_reward_gap: 2.78\n      exp008f_reward_gap: 1.01\n    result_rationale: |\n      RSSM fidelity analysis 已完成。关键发现：008d 的低 obs gap ratio (1.30×)\n      具有误导性——其 dt=1 绝对误差 41.31 已是 baseline 3×（模型整体已退化）。\n      008d 的 reward gap 2.78× 意味着 dt=2 reward 预测系统性偏差，\n      这直接导致 critic 在 dt>1 imagination steps 获得错误 value targets。\n      008f reward gap 1.01× 表明没有 dt_embedding 时 reward head 无法\n      区分 dt=1/dt=2（reward 预测都很差但均匀差），消除了系统性偏差。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"RSSM Fidelity Table（论文 Table 1）\"\n        rows:\n          - model: \"baseline\"\n            dt1_obs_MSE: 13.49\n            dt2_obs_MSE: 27.50\n            obs_gap: \"2.04×\"\n            dt1_reward_MAE: 0.0102\n            dt2_reward_MAE: 0.0159\n            reward_gap: \"1.56×\"\n          - model: \"008d (trained dt_emb)\"\n            dt1_obs_MSE: 41.31\n            dt2_obs_MSE: 53.67\n            obs_gap: \"1.30×\"\n            dt1_reward_MAE: 0.0568\n            dt2_reward_MAE: 0.1579\n            reward_gap: \"2.78×\"\n          - model: \"008f (no dt_emb)\"\n            dt1_obs_MSE: 8.01\n            dt2_obs_MSE: 22.04\n            obs_gap: \"2.75×\"\n            dt1_reward_MAE: 0.7469\n            dt2_reward_MAE: 0.7526\n            reward_gap: \"1.01×\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"双轴柱状图：绝对误差（左轴）+ gap ratio（右轴），三模型并排\"\n    analysis: |\n      论文必须同时报告绝对误差和比率，避免 008d 的低 obs gap ratio (1.30×)\n      误导审稿人认为 \"trained dt_emb 改善了 dt=2 预测\"——实际上是 dt=1\n      也变差了。核心证据链：trained dt_emb + RSSM fidelity gap → dt=2\n      reward 系统性偏差 → critic 在 imagination 中积累错误 value → CIVO。\n\n  - name: \"Actor entropy analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_031\"\n    description: \"健康 vs 崩溃配置的 actor entropy 动力学\"\n    expected_results:\n      collapsed_008d_s0_entropy_55K: -4.88\n      collapsed_008d_s0_entropy_trend: \"monotonic decrease → exploitation\"\n      healthy_008a_s0_entropy_105K: -4.2\n      healthy_008a_s0_entropy_trend: \"stable after initial decrease\"\n      pathway_b_008e_v3_s2_entropy_95K: -4.53\n      pathway_b_008e_v3_s2_entropy_105K: -3.83\n      pathway_b_entropy_trend: \"decrease then INCREASE at collapse\"\n      baseline_entropy_105K: -5.0\n      baseline_entropy_trend: \"monotonic decrease then stable ~-5.0\"\n    result_rationale: |\n      Entropy 动力学是区分 Pathway A（CIVO）和 Pathway B（non-CIVO）的关键。\n      Pathway A（008d）：entropy 持续下降（actor 变得越来越确定，exploitation\n      被错误 critic 驱动向错误方向）→ 这是经典 value overestimation 签名。\n      Pathway B（008e_v3_s2）：entropy 先正常下降后在崩溃前上升（-5.21→-3.83），\n      表明 actor 变得不确定/随机 → 这是 policy destabilization 而非 exploitation。\n      健康配置（008a）：entropy 正常下降后稳定，无异常。\n      这个分析 0 GPU cost，直接从 metrics.jsonl 提取。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Entropy signature by collapse pathway\"\n        rows:\n          - pathway: \"Healthy (008a, baseline)\"\n            entropy_pattern: \"↓ then stable\"\n            late_training_entropy: \"-4.2 to -5.0\"\n          - pathway: \"Pathway A / CIVO (008d)\"\n            entropy_pattern: \"↓↓ monotonic\"\n            late_training_entropy: \"-4.88 (exploitation)\"\n          - pathway: \"Pathway B / non-CIVO (008e_v3_s2)\"\n            entropy_pattern: \"↓ then ↑\"\n            late_training_entropy: \"-3.83 (destabilization)\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Actor entropy vs training step，4 配置叠加，标注崩溃 onset\"\n    analysis: |\n      Entropy 分析为 dual-pathway 论证提供独立支持证据。\n      可直接用作论文 Figure（或 appendix figure）区分两种崩溃机制。\n\n  - name: \"Value prediction distribution vs realized returns\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_032\"\n    description: \"V(s) vs Monte Carlo return 分布对比\"\n    expected_results:\n      trained_dt_emb_dt2_value_mean: 97.5\n      trained_dt_emb_dt2_mc_return_mean: 55\n      trained_dt_emb_dt2_overestimation_gap: \"+77%\"\n      trained_dt_emb_dt1_value_mean: 60\n      trained_dt_emb_dt1_mc_return_mean: 58\n      trained_dt_emb_dt1_gap: \"+3%\"\n      untrained_dt_emb_dt2_value_mean: 50\n      untrained_dt_emb_dt2_mc_return_mean: 52\n      untrained_dt_emb_dt2_gap: \"-4%\"\n      overlap_coefficient: 0.35\n    result_rationale: |\n      分布分析比标量 v/e 更 informative——能直接展示 trained dt_emb 在 dt=2\n      transitions 上的系统性右偏。预期 trained dt_emb 的 dt=2 value 分布\n      明显右移（overestimate ~77%），但存在重叠区域（overlap coefficient ~0.35），\n      使得分析不如 best-case 干净。dt=1 transitions 在所有配置下大致校准（gap <5%），\n      确认过高估仅在 dt>1 触发。untrained dt_emb 的 dt=2 value 轻微低估（-4%），\n      与 nve<1.0× 一致。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description:\n      - \"核密度图：V(s) vs MC return，训练/未训练 dt_emb × dt=1/dt=2 四面板\"\n    analysis: |\n      分布分析强化 C2 但因重叠区域存在，证据强度为 moderate 而非 strong。\n      论文中可放 appendix。\n\n  - name: \"dt_embedding cosine similarity analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_033\"\n    description: \"训练过程中 dt=1 和 dt=2 embedding 向量的相似度演化\"\n    expected_results:\n      cosine_sim_init: 0.92\n      cosine_sim_25K: 0.65\n      cosine_sim_55K: 0.40\n      cosine_sim_105K: 0.32\n      frozen_cosine_sim: 0.91\n      l2_distance_growth: \"monotonic increase from 0.3 to 2.1\"\n    result_rationale: |\n      Trained dt_emb 的 dt=1 和 dt=2 embedding 在训练中逐渐分化（cosine similarity\n      从 ~0.92 降至 ~0.32），表明网络学会了区分不同 temporal scales。\n      这个分化本身是正确的学习行为——问题在于 RSSM 的预测质量不支持\n      这种区分精度。在 frozen 配置中 cosine similarity 保持固定（~0.91），\n      确认分化是 training-driven。分析有趣但不是核心诊断指标，放 appendix。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Cosine similarity vs training step，叠加 trained/frozen/untrained 配置\"\n    analysis: |\n      Supplementary evidence：dt_emb 确实学习了 temporal discrimination，\n      但这反而成了问题——越精确的 dt conditioning + 越不精确的 RSSM =\n      越严重的 CIVO。放 appendix。\n\n  - name: \"NVE threshold sensitivity analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_034\"\n    description: \"0 GPU cost——从已有指标计算不同阈值的分类精度\"\n    expected_results:\n      threshold_1_3x:\n        accuracy: 0.71\n        false_positives: 2\n        false_negatives: 0\n        note: \"009c nve=1.14 和 Cheetah control 部分 seed 的 transient exceedance\"\n      threshold_1_5x:\n        accuracy: 0.83\n        false_positives: 1\n        false_negatives: 0\n        note: \"Cheetah control seed 2 nve peak 1.75× 是唯一 borderline case\"\n      threshold_1_7x:\n        accuracy: 0.92\n        false_positives: 0\n        false_negatives: 0\n        note: \"all trained seeds exceed; no control seeds exceed\"\n      threshold_2_0x:\n        accuracy: 0.92\n        false_positives: 0\n        false_negatives: 1\n        note: \"009b peak nve=2.05× 仅在 25K (unreliable timepoint)\"\n      auroc: 0.88\n      optimal_threshold: 1.7\n      recommended_threshold: 1.5\n      recommended_threshold_note: \"1.5× 更保守，更适合诊断预警\"\n      sample_size: \"~12 data points (6 trained, 6 control across 2 environments)\"\n    result_rationale: |\n      Median 档核心预测：nve_threshold_classification_accuracy 在 0.75-0.90。\n      1.5× 阈值精度 ~83%（6/7 或类似）因 Cheetah control 出现 1 个 borderline case。\n      这是 median 与 best-case 的关键差异——best-case 中 Walker 4/4 完美分类\n      扩展到跨环境仍然完美。AUROC ~0.88 仍然表明 NVE 是有意义的诊断指标，\n      但不再是 \"perfect separator\"。1.7× 阈值实现 0/0 error 但丧失了对\n      transient overestimation 的早期预警能力。论文推荐 1.5× 并注明\n      环境敏感性。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"NVE threshold classification performance\"\n        rows:\n          - threshold: \"1.3×\"\n            accuracy: \"71% (5/7)\"\n            sensitivity: \"100%\"\n            specificity: \"67%\"\n          - threshold: \"1.5×\"\n            accuracy: \"83% (5/6)\"\n            sensitivity: \"100%\"\n            specificity: \"83%\"\n          - threshold: \"1.7×\"\n            accuracy: \"92%\"\n            sensitivity: \"100%\"\n            specificity: \"100%\"\n          - threshold: \"2.0×\"\n            accuracy: \"92%\"\n            sensitivity: \"83%\"\n            specificity: \"100%\"\n      - title: \"Bootstrap CI for trained vs control Δ NVE\"\n        rows:\n          - metric: \"Mean Δ NVE (trained - control)\"\n            value: \"+2.1\"\n            ci_95: \"[+0.5, +3.2]\"\n          - metric: \"Exceedance probability P(trained > control)\"\n            value: \"90%\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"ROC 曲线：NVE 阈值对 CIVO/non-CIVO 的分类性能\"\n      - \"Threshold sensitivity 柱状图：accuracy vs threshold level\"\n    analysis: |\n      NVE 1.5× 阈值从 \"perfect separator\" 降级为 \"strong but imperfect diagnostic\"。\n      论文措辞需要调整：从 \"4/4 perfect classification\" 到 \"83-92% classification\n      accuracy depending on threshold, with one borderline control case in\n      Cheetah Run.\" Bootstrap CI lower bound = 0.5（在 median 档的 0.1-0.9 范围内），\n      exceedance probability = 90%（在 80-95% 范围内）。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # Cartpole Swingup（来不及完成）\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"Cartpole Swingup baseline (3 seeds)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_050\"\n    description: \"第三环境 dt=1 baseline\"\n    expected_results:\n      status: \"NOT_COMPLETED_BEFORE_DEADLINE\"\n      estimated_baseline_if_run: \"~800-860 (DreamerV3 typical)\"\n      gpu_hours_needed: 15\n      reason_skipped: \"GPU budget 和 deadline 限制\"\n    result_rationale: |\n      Median 档核心假设之一：\"Cartpole 实验来不及完成（仅 2 环境）\"。\n      CoRL 2026-05-29 deadline 前 GPU 预算不足以完成 3 个 Cartpole 配置\n      × 3 seeds。论文以 Walker + Cheetah 两环境提交。\n      Reviewers 可能质疑仅 2 环境的泛化性——rebuttal 中承诺提供 Cartpole 数据。\n      这是 median 档与 best-case 的第二大差异（best-case 有 3 环境）。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: |\n      论文 limitations 需明确声明：\"Results are demonstrated in two DMC\n      locomotion environments (Walker Walk, Cheetah Run). Generalization to\n      non-locomotion tasks requires further investigation.\"\n\n  - name: \"Cartpole Swingup trained dt_emb + subsample ON (3 seeds)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_051\"\n    description: \"Cartpole CIVO 触发\"\n    expected_results:\n      status: \"NOT_COMPLETED_BEFORE_DEADLINE\"\n    result_rationale: \"依赖 plan_050 baseline，无法在 deadline 前完成。\"\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"跳过，与 plan_050 相同原因。\"\n\n  - name: \"Cartpole Swingup dt_embed_dim=0 + subsample ON (3 seeds)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_052\"\n    description: \"Cartpole 因果控制\"\n    expected_results:\n      status: \"NOT_COMPLETED_BEFORE_DEADLINE\"\n    result_rationale: \"依赖 plan_050 baseline，无法在 deadline 前完成。\"\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"跳过，与 plan_050 相同原因。\"\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # 进阶实验\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"Uncertainty-gated imagination truncation pilot\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_060\"\n    description: \"基于 RSSM 预测不确定性截断 imagination rollout\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_105K: 580\n      vs_baseline: \"-37%\"\n      nve_peak: 1.3\n      collapse: false\n      collapse_rate_if_multi_seed: \"~25% (1/4 estimate)\"\n      truncation_rate_avg: \"40% of dt=2 steps truncated\"\n      effective_horizon: \"~11 steps (vs H=15 nominal)\"\n    result_rationale: |\n      Uncertainty-gated truncation 在 RSSM 预测不确定性超过阈值时截断 imagination。\n      Median 档预期：方法在单 seed 试点中表现有希望（无崩溃，nve<1.5×），\n      但性能恢复有限（仅 ~63% baseline），因为 truncation 过于激进\n      （40% dt=2 步被截断，effective horizon 缩短至 11 步）。\n      这说明 truncation 地址了 Pathway A 但可能引入新的性能限制。\n      作为 Discussion 中的 future work 方向有价值，但作为独立 contribution 不足。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Truncation rate vs training step 叠加 NVE 曲线\"\n    analysis: |\n      Pilot 结果可放 appendix 或 Discussion 的 future work 段。\n      不足以作为论文的 mitigation contribution（那需要多 seed + 跨环境验证）。\n\n  - name: \"Hopper Hop validation (3 seeds × 3 configs)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_040\"\n    description: \"第三环境（非提交优先级）\"\n    expected_results:\n      status: \"NOT_COMPLETED_BEFORE_DEADLINE\"\n      gpu_hours_needed: 45\n    result_rationale: |\n      P2 优先级 + 45 GPU hours 需求，在 CoRL deadline 前不可行。\n      即使 Cartpole 完成，Hopper 也超出预算。留作后续工作。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"P2 实验，不影响当前提交。\"\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # 衍生分析（非 plan 但影响 median 定义）\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"008f_s3 borderline NVE (registry: exp_008f_s3_no_dt_embed_walker)\"\n    plan_id: \"registry_only\"\n    description: \"Walker Walk 008f 第 3 个 seed——median 档 borderline case\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_105K: 250\n      nve_peak: 1.42\n      nve_peak_step: 85000\n      nve_105K: 1.10\n      collapse: false\n      borderline_for_threshold: true\n    result_rationale: |\n      Median 档核心假设：'008f_s3 NVE 在 1.2-1.6×（borderline，削弱 threshold 完美分类）'。\n      seed 0 nve peak=1.02, seed 1 nve peak=1.05, seed 2 (009c) nve peak=1.26。\n      seed 3 预期 nve peak ~1.42×，接近但未超过 1.5× 阈值。如果 Cheetah control\n      没有提供 borderline case，008f_s3 就是削弱分类精度的数据点。\n      即使 nve peak <1.5×，其值（1.42×）足够高以引起审稿人对阈值鲁棒性的质疑。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: |\n      008f_s3 + Cheetah control seed 2 合计提供 1-2 个 borderline cases，\n      将 NVE 1.5× 阈值精度从 perfect 降至 ~83%。\n\n  - name: \"018v2 Full-SGS 确认分析 (registry: exp_018v2_full_sgs_walker_s1)\"\n    plan_id: \"registry_only\"\n    description: \"Full-SGS 消除 CIVO 但不恢复性能\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_105K: 448\n      vs_baseline: \"49% (448/916)\"\n      nve_sustained: 1.05\n      nve_peak: 1.25\n      civo_eliminated: true\n      performance_recovery: \"partial (49%)\"\n      civo_independent_contribution_pp: 28\n    result_rationale: |\n      Median 档预期 full_sgs_018v2_nve_sustained 在 0.8-1.3× 区间，\n      eval 仅恢复到 ~49% baseline。018v2 通过 Full-SGS（移除 observation\n      decoder 对 dt_emb 的 93% 梯度通路）消除 CIVO（nve ≤ 1.25×），\n      但性能仅恢复到 448（vs 008d 崩溃至 131，baseline 916）。\n      CIVO 独立贡献 = 008d@105K baseline ratio - 018v2@105K baseline ratio\n      = (916-131)/916 - (916-448)/916 ≈ 86% - 51% = 35pp（上界）。\n      但 median 档承认 inherent multi-dt cost confound：018v2 的 49%\n      恢复意味着至少 51% 的退化来自 inherent cost（非 CIVO 因素），\n      使 CIVO 独立贡献的下界为 ~20pp。范围：20-35pp。\n      Sensitivity analysis 展示不同分解假设下的结果。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"CIVO decomposition sensitivity analysis\"\n        rows:\n          - assumption: \"Upper bound: all 008d-018v2 gap = CIVO\"\n            civo_pp: 35\n            inherent_cost_pp: 51\n          - assumption: \"Mid estimate: 018v2 inherent cost = 008a inherent cost\"\n            civo_pp: 28\n            inherent_cost_pp: 58\n          - assumption: \"Lower bound: inherent cost dominant\"\n            civo_pp: 20\n            inherent_cost_pp: 66\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Stacked bar chart: baseline performance decomposed into retained + inherent cost + CIVO contribution\"\n    analysis: |\n      CIVO 独立贡献 20-35pp 是 median 档的核心量化发现。\n      论文措辞从 \"35pp independent contribution\" 改为 \"20-35pp range,\n      with the upper bound limited by potential confounding from inherent\n      multi-dt training cost.\" Sensitivity analysis 是必须的附加材料。\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"4712391e-8d6d-4492-afa6-ac943e7a7e9a","total_cost_usd":0.91239475,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":41613,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"output_tokens":24388,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":41613,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":24388,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation_input_tokens":41613,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":41613},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":36573,"outputTokens":22,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.036683,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":24388,"cacheReadInputTokens":11841,"cacheCreationInputTokens":41613,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.87571175,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"9ee96d86-eb10-420b-87f5-c5441301a20d"}
